Flask-Script-NG Changelog
=========================

Version 2.1
-----------------

Released on February 27, 2026

- Base the project on Flask-Script 2.0.6 (commit f141a33)
- Rename project to Flask-Script-NG
- Support modern Python>=3.6 and Flask>=2.2.4
- Update the test requirements to pytest>=7.0, Python>=3.8,<=3.15
- Remove the outdated examples and docs that are duplicate of Flask-Script docs
